## SECTION C: FINAL INTEGRATED SHORTLIST & EVALUATION MATRIX

To establish a balanced list suitable for publication, candidate priorities were scored using a standardized formula incorporating all stakeholder criteria:

$$\text{Composite Score (\%)} = \left( \frac{\text{Magnitude (20\%)} + \text{Evidence (20\%)} + \text{Cost-Effectiveness (20\%)} + \text{Strategic Alignment (15\%)} + \text{Multi-Horizon (15\%)} + \text{Equity (10\%)}}{5} \right) \times 100$$

